### Get selectable TTS voices
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tts/voices
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Get company voice settings
GET http://localhost:8080/api/settings/voice
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

### Update voice settings
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/settings/voice
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "speed": 1.0,
  "pitch": 0.0
}
